      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPARTUS (2) was thrown in the deep end two-back when eleventh to Ice Kool over this trip at Randwick in BM78 grade. Back to his right class when he sat off the fast pace to get up in a tight finish over 1000m at Wyong. Maps well again and hard to stop in this vein of form. HARLEX (1) speared to the lead from a wide alley before fading in the straight to run seventh over 1300m at Rosehill in the heavy (9) conditions. Winning apprentice hops back aboard and expected to go close. DIETRICH (6) smart mare who resumes from a lengthy break. Saves her best for the home track where she has the two wins from six starts. Well placed with Chambers' claim and fitted with a searching 1000m trial placing at this track. Has solid winning claims. APOLLO RIDGE (4) at his top now and has a key jockey change after going under narrowly when 5th over 1100m at Hawkesbury. Expected to take a hand in the finish.",
